world.json is the globe's map (features/thursday/here-map.ts): Natural Earth's 1:50m Admin 0
countries, version 4.1.0, as world-atlas 2.0.2 redistributes them in TopoJSON, simplified and
packed by scripts/here-map.mts, with each country's ISO 3166 two-letter code from the table in
i18n-iso-countries 7.14.0.

Natural Earth, https://www.naturalearthdata.com/: "All versions of Natural Earth raster + vector
map data found on this website are in the public domain."

